hing the claim.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-002\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"it separates one instrumented process from another.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text contains this statement with 'from another' conveying identical meaning to the claim's 'from the next'.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-003\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Only letters, digits, spaces and hyphens are accepted\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text directly states this constraint on accepted stream name characters.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-004\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text provides workaround instructions but neither states nor contradicts whether a fix is available at present.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-005\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text provides workaround instructions but neither states nor contradicts whether a fix is available at present.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":46997,"type":"result","duration_ms":52332,"uuid":"50338f94-f58d-4c45-998e-4c7b3219a8ad","ttft_stream_ms":1118,"time_to_request_ms":91,"first_content_frame_ms":1119,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
